# Where the official minted renders are served from, without a trailing slash.
# The wallet picker loads <base>/<slug>/<address>.png; leave it unset and it
# composites the same look from trait layers instead, which is pixel-identical.
# Only collections marked `renders` in lib/collections.ts use it — Piggy Gang's
# bucket holds the art its redraw replaced. Populate with `pnpm renders:upload`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_RENDER_BASE_URL=

# The PiggyGang Indexer, which answers which piggies a connected wallet holds.
# Optional — lib/indexer.ts ships the production default, so the app needs no
# configuration at all. Public, read-only and unauthenticated: there is no
# secret here, and the app never signs or writes anything.
NEXT_PUBLIC_INDEXER_URL=
